  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Participatory development integral proposal reparation of UP victims - Reiniciar - Support to Reiniciar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Participatory development integral proposal reparation of UP victims - Reiniciar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta f&#xf6;rslag som lagts fram av Reiniciar syftar till att utarbeta en deltagande utveckling av en integrerad f&#xf6;rslag om ers&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r UP   offer, inom ramen f&#xf6;r processen f&#xf6;r integrerad st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rsvaret av  sina r&#xe4;ttigheter innan de Interamerikanska system f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga       r&#xe4;ttigheter-IAHRS och ansvariga nationella myndigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal submitted by Reiniciar aims to draw up a participatory  development of an integral proposal for reparation of UP victims, in  the framework of the process of integral assistance for the defence   of their rights before the Inter-American Human Rights System-IAHRS   and the responsible national authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
